      "updated": "2026-03-31T11:00:10Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/easydiffusion/easydiffusion/releases/tag/v3.0.16",
      "notes_html": "<p>🔥 Adds support for:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Flux 2 Klein, Z-Image, Qwen and lots more models (including quantized gguf)!</li>\n<li>Improves support for AMD and Intel GPUs (including integrated)</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Enable the <code>v4</code> engine to get the new features:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Open the <code>Settings</code> tab in Easy Diffusion's UI.</li>\n<li>Select <code>v4 engine</code> in the Backend option.</li>\n<li>Press <code>Save</code> and restart Easy Diffusion.</li>\n</ol>",
      "assets": [
