    {
      "title": "v3.0.13",
      "updated": "2025-08-08T11:03:40Z",
      "url": "https://github.com/easydiffusion/easydiffusion/releases/tag/v3.0.13",
      "notes_html": "<p>Adds support for Chroma, Krea and the latest models in the beta branch. To use it:</p>\n<ol>\n<li>Please install Easy Diffusion (using the download links below)</li>\n<li>After installing it, please enable <code>Beta</code> in the <code>Settings</code> tab (inside Easy Diffusion's interface).</li>\n<li>Then press <code>Save</code> and restart Easy Diffusion.</li>\n<li>Then select <code>v3.5 engine</code> in the <code>Settings</code> tab (in Easy Diffusion).</li>\n<li>Again, press <code>Save</code> and restart Easy Diffusion.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>This will allow you to use the latest models like Krea, Chroma, Flux etc in Easy Diffusion</p>",
